- This narrows X to at most 2 possibilities in {1,...,100}
- A 7th question (e.g., using gcd with 3) distinguishes the remaining pair
- Lower bound: 2^6 = 64 < 100, so 6 questions insufficient by counting argument
- Answer: k = 7

